{
 "id": 1796055,
 "titulo": "8/8 Patch Details (Completed)",
 "fecha": 1691478058911,
 "modificada": 1750243234460,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1796055",
 "html": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" data-error-type=\"RETRY\" id=\"1642728194502\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/4f8b670f4bb44859ac42285020b6dfde_1642728194502_d.jpg\"></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Greetings, Agents.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">This is CM Fragment of MARVEL Future Fight.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, prepare to spend the summer with&nbsp;<br>\nfantastic performance, the stage decorated with lilacs,<br>\nand future technologies that transcend centuries!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Luna Snow</span> will be the center of the stage that will blast the summer&nbsp;<br>\nwith her new Uniform and Tier-4.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Mysterio </span>will invite Agents to the world of illusions&nbsp;with his new Uniform.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Also, use the metaphysical abilities of the<br>\nNative Tier-3 <span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">Kang the Conqueror</span> in battles.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Agents, check out the new skills and power of the updated heroes<br>\nby downloading the 8/8 Patch!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><strong>■ 8/8 Patch Details</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Patch Schedule: 8/9 (Wed) 3:00 (UTC+0), 8/8 (Tue) 20:00 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">[8/9 (Wed) 3:07 (UTC+0), 8/8 (Tue) 20:07 (PDT) added]</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">The patch has been completed as of 8/9 (Wed) 3:06 (UTC+0), 8/8 (Tue) 20:06 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Please reconnect to the game and download the patch file.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The patch completion time may be changed depending on the circumstances&nbsp;<br>\nand the </span><span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\">completion time will be announced</span><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"> once the patch has been finished.<br>\n* The patch will be applied in waves and the application time may vary by Agent.<br>\n* The game can still be accessed during the patch.<br>\nWhen the patch is complete, please restart and apply the patch for better service.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ One New Hero</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Kang the Conqueror &lt;<em>Ant-Man and the Wasp: Quantumania</em>&gt; has been added. &nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1668\" id=\"1691459046279\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/167f5f46efd74b73931041621c76102c_1691459046279_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Two New Uniforms</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Two new Uniforms Luna Snow &lt;Summer Lilac&gt;&nbsp;<br>\nand Mysterio &lt;Summer Mystery&gt; has been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* The two new Uniforms can be purchased after the 8/8 Patch data has been applied.<br>\n* The new Uniforms can be purchased during the event period.</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Luna Snow &lt;Summer Lilac&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 8/8 Patch - 8/25 (Fri) 14:59 (UTC+0), After the 8/8 Patch - 8/25 (Fri) 7:59 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Can be exchanged at the Event Shop with Cool Summer Tokens<br>\n- Cool Summer Tokens can be acquired by purchasing event products or more&nbsp;<br>\nuntil 8/22 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), 4/18 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT).&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#8e44ad;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▶ Mysterio &lt;Summer Mystery&gt;:&nbsp;<br>\nAfter the 8/8 Patch - 8/22 (Tue) 14:59 (UTC+0), After the 8/8 Patch - 8/22 (Tue) 7:59 (PDT)&nbsp;</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#2980b9;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">- Purchase method: Crystal purchase (Discount events will not be applied.)</span></span></span><br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">* Summer Uniforms may be available again through similar events or packages after the event.&nbsp;<br>\n* New Uniform Skills are based on the following skill Level stats. (Tier-4 heroes: Lv. 10, Others: Lv. 6) &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1694\" id=\"1691459116245\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/f20a5860b9a04817a1ca66a15a6d04c1_1691459116245_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"1193\" id=\"1691459116257\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8481596a533443669fc7280f316e422e_1691459116257_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ Luna Snow Tier-4</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Luna Snow is now available for Tier-4 Advancement.<br>\nHer fans and even her enemies will be riveted by her looks surrounded by numerous ice crystals.</span></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The skill effects are based on Lv.6 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"274\" id=\"1691459165029\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/8786efec73804ffaae86b481aeb15f3f_1691459165029_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Kang the Conqueror Tier-3 Skill</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Check out the Tier-3 Ultimate Skill of Kang the Conqueror.<br>\nKeep your eyes on the Super Villain who has moved to conquer every timeline!</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"342\" id=\"1691459201677\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/bfd93ff727794b009adc224cb80a254e_1691459201677_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<strong><span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">▣ New Artifact</span></span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">A new Artifact has been added for Kang the Conqueror.<br>\n<span style=\"color:#ff0099;\">* The effects are based on the 6★ Artifact passive skill Lv.4 stats.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"325\" id=\"1691459228316\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/5cd965e6e8354102a6ed79f3b013616a_1691459228316_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<span style=\"color:#e67e22;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><strong>▣ Other Information</strong></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">1. Some skills of Odin &lt;Avengers 1,000,000 BC&gt; has been improved.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"708\" id=\"1691459650845\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/477d3af7083646cbbfb739fa51478301_1691459650845_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" width=\"740\"></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">We look forward to your active participation in the events&nbsp;<br>\nthat will be held to support the growth of the updated heroes.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\">Thank you.</span></span></p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana,Geneva,sans-serif;\"><img alt=\"\" id=\"1691458882308\" name=\"currImg\" src=\"https://hedwig-cf.netmarble.com/forum-common/mherosgb/futurefight_en/thumbnail/e1608c23f7bc4b72bb8b3f123b400a46_1691458882308_d.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\"></span></span></p>\n"
}